message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Software and Computational Notebooks for "Eulerian and Lagrangian Assessment of Arctic Surface Current Products Using Drifter Observations"
abstract: >
  Eulerian evaluation pipeline and Lagrangian Uncertainty Quantification (LUQ) framework to evaluate satellite-derived ocean surface current products (including regular and curvilinear gridded models) against in-situ observations from the Global Drifter Program (GDP) across the Arctic Ocean.
